    "answer": {
      "short": "No, they are incorrect. The area is only $0.785\\text{ km}^2$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}r &= 1\\div2 = 0.5\\text{ km}\\\\A &= \\pi r^2\\\\A &= \\pi(0.5)^2\\\\A &= \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\text{ km}^2\\\\A &\\approx 0.785\\text{ km}^2\\end{align*}$$\nNo. The area is less than $1\\text{ km}^2$, so the news report is incorrect.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
